{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D real-time strategy game with base building, resource management, and chaotic slime battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Slime Wars</strong>, take command in fast-paced RTS matches where you gather resources, build up your base, train a gooey army, and crush your enemies. Whether you're defending your own slime stronghold or launching an all-out assault, every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smarter. Attack harder. Emerge victorious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest</strong> resources to expand your economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> and upgrade your base with strategic structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train</strong> unique slime units, each with their own strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong> enemy bases while defending your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt</strong> your strategy in real-time against enemy tactics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>RTS gameplay</strong> with a 2D twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base-building</strong>, <strong>tech progression</strong>, and <strong>unit production</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>unit types and abilities</strong> to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, chaotic world full of gooey warfare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and (future) multiplayer modes planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned RTS veteran or new to the genre, <strong>Slime Wars</strong> offers a tight, tactical experience wrapped in a colorful, chaotic world of slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkout the Patreon to support our development!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887080?t=1765750720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887080?t=1765750720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887080/f3bab1f8917bbde4f736f5b1afa898b97e8983b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765750720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887080/f3bab1f8917bbde4f736f5b1afa898b97e8983b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765750720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D real-time strategy game with base building, resource management, and chaotic slime battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Slime Wars</strong>, take command in fast-paced RTS matches where you gather resources, build up your base, train a gooey army, and crush your enemies. Whether you're defending your own slime stronghold or launching an all-out assault, every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smarter. Attack harder. Emerge victorious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest</strong> resources to expand your economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> and upgrade your base with strategic structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train</strong> unique slime units, each with their own strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong> enemy bases while defending your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt</strong> your strategy in real-time against enemy tactics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>RTS gameplay</strong> with a 2D twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base-building</strong>, <strong>tech progression</strong>, and <strong>unit production</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>unit types and abilities</strong> to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, chaotic world full of gooey warfare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and (future) multiplayer modes planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned RTS veteran or new to the genre, <strong>Slime Wars</strong> offers a tight, tactical experience wrapped in a colorful, chaotic world of slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkout the Patreon to support our development!\u00a0</p>","developers":["Phantom Studios"],"dlc":[2891070],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887080/d00e287b59524b19f727a9377babc592c29be54d/header.jpg?t=1765750720","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2887080/918011191/9af00072d93fe494492e8b5e6e2454f7910b3b56/1764894953/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764895225","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2887080/918011191/9af00072d93fe494492e8b5e6e2454f7910b3b56/1764894953/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764895225","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2887080/918011191/9af00072d93fe494492e8b5e6e2454f7910b3b56/1764894953/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764895225","id":257243801,"name":"Alpha Release","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor